msgid "Shells"
msgstr "Shells"

#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/shells/shells.xml:14
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"We are all familiar with the Bourne Again SHell, but there are two other "
"user interfaces that are considered useful modern shells &ndash; the "
"Berkeley Unix C shell and the Korn shell.  This chapter installs packages "
"compatible with these additional shell types."
msgstr ""
"Estamos todos familiarizados com o Bourne Again SHell, mas existem duas "
"outras interfaces de usuário(a) que são consideradas shells modernos úteis "
"&ndash; o shell Berkeley Unix C e o shell Korn. Este capítulo instala "
"pacotes compatíveis com esses tipos adicionais de shell."
